TITLE:: ProbeTheme
summary:: Theme engine and immutable palette definitions for Probe
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeBroker

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeTheme defines the color palettes, densities, and performance presets for Probe instruments. Themes are treated as pure data: changing themes or densities never reallocates audio synths, buffers, or FFT chains.

Six default themes are provided:
list::
## strong::\graphite:: (default dark slate theme)
## strong::\phosphor:: (classic terminal / vintage green theme)
## strong::\ice:: (high-contrast cool blue theme)
## strong::\amber:: (warm CRT glow theme)
## strong::\paper:: (light background studio drafting theme)
## strong::\monochrome:: (grayscale minimalist theme)
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: get
Returns the theme associated with the given name (or the default if not found).

ARGUMENT:: themeOrName
Theme name symbol or ProbeTheme instance.

METHOD:: current
Get or set the current active theme.

ARGUMENT:: val
Optional ProbeTheme instance to set.

METHOD:: defaultFontScale
Get or set the default typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: scale
Float scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: register
Registers a new custom theme dictionary.

ARGUMENT:: themeName
Symbol name for the theme.

ARGUMENT:: dict
IdentityDictionary of theme colors and options.

METHOD:: themes
Returns the dictionary of all registered themes.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: name
Returns the theme's symbolic name.

METHOD:: density
Get or set the density preset (code::\micro::, code::\compact::, or code::\extended::).

ARGUMENT:: aDensity
Optional density symbol to set.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the theme's typography scale factor.

ARGUMENT:: scale
Float scale factor between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: withFontScale
Returns a copy with the given font scale.

ARGUMENT:: newScale
Float scale factor.

METHOD:: withDensity
Returns a new theme instance with the requested density without mutating the original.

ARGUMENT:: newDensity
code::\micro::, code::\compact::, or code::\extended::.

METHOD:: withPreset
Returns a new theme instance with the requested performance preset.

ARGUMENT:: newPreset
code::\eco::, code::\normal::, or code::\detailed::.

METHOD:: font
Returns a calibrated Font object scaled by the theme's typography factor.

ARGUMENT:: baseSize
Base font size in points.

ARGUMENT:: bold
Boolean for bold face.

ARGUMENT:: mono
Boolean for monospace font.

METHOD:: copy
Returns a new copy of the theme with optional property overrides.

ARGUMENT:: overrides
Optional dictionary of property overrides.

METHOD:: updateFrequency
Returns recommended telemetry update frequency in Hz for active preset.

METHOD:: targetFPS
Returns recommended GUI target FPS for active preset.
